  + cantor-lifecycle-evidence-verify is provider-independent and fails closed on unknown fields altered coordinates altered raw byte accounts altered restart state altered direct responses or altered summaries
  + this establishes transport compression only and makes no model-token or end-to-end inference-latency claim

